{"parse": {"title": "Maniacal monkey", "pageid": 72514, "redirects": [], "wikitext": "{{otheruses|the monster|other uses|Maniacal monkey (disambiguation)}}\n{{HasStrategy}}\n{{Infobox Monster\n|name = Maniacal monkey\n|image = [[File:Maniacal monkey.png|200px]]\n|release = [[6 May]] [[2016]]\n|update = Monkey Madness II\n|members = Yes\n|combat = 140\n|size = 1\n|examine = It looks like someone has tampered with its mind.\n|xpbonus = 0\n|max hit = 18\n|aggressive = Yes\n|poisonous = No\n|attack style = [[Slash]]\n|attack speed = 4\n|respawn = 50\n|slayxp = 65\n|cat = Monkeys\n|assignedby = turael,spria\n|hitpoints = 65\n|att = 200\n|str = 175\n|def = 10\n|mage = 1\n|range = 1\n|attbns = 0\n|strbns = 0\n|amagic = 0\n|mbns = 0\n|arange = 0\n|rngbns = 0\n|dstab = 0\n|dslash = 0\n|dcrush = 0\n|dmagic = 0\n|dlight = 0\n|dstandard = 0\n|dheavy = 0\n|poisonresistance = 0\n|venomresistance = 0\n|immunecannon = No\n|immunethrall = No\n|id = 7118\n}}\n'''Maniacal monkeys''' are located in [[Kruk's Dungeon]] which the player visits during [[Monkey Madness II]].\n\nCompared to the [[Skeleton (Ape Atoll)|skeletal monkeys]] in the [[Ape Atoll Dungeon]], maniacal monkeys may be seen as a better choice for players wishing to train [[Ranged]] or [[Magic]] with multi-target attacks due to their extremely dense spawn and much lower defence. However, as maniacal monkeys are '''not''' undead, the effects of the [[salve amulet(ei)]] do not apply, whilst they do for the skeletal monkeys. On the other hand, maniacal monkeys have a high aggression range and come in large quantities, and also commonly drop one-dose [[prayer potion]]s to replenish prayer points. These potions are dropped more frequently than used, reducing the overall cost of training here. The lower level of Kruk's Dungeon may require a [[Light sources|light source]].\n\n==Location==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Maniacal monkey\n|location = [[Kruk's Dungeon]] (Lower Level)\n|levels = 140\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = 10